<title>UK: BTI sets call warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>BTI sets call warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc</p>
<p>has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on Novartis</p>
<p>Namen, lead manager Bankers Trust AG said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,200 CHF		 PREMIUM	15.79 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.06 CHF		  GEARING	18.79 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	26.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,991.5 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
